Encrypted scheduled backups and isolated restore checks

Usage: leptoskit infra backups <COMMAND>

Commands:
  install  Installs or updates the worker, credentials, schedule, and retention
  run      Takes, encrypts, uploads, restores for verification, and retains a backup
  list     Lists remote encrypted snapshots
  verify   Restores a snapshot into an isolated temporary Postgres container
  status   Reports verification, age, and the last backup failure
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help     Print help
  -V, --version  Print version
